<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.01 Transitional//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/html4/loose.dtd">
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" lang="ko" xml:lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
	<meta http-equiv='Content-Type' content='text/html;charset=UTF-8'/>
	<title>도매꾹 - 요청하신 페이지를 표시할 수 없습니다.</title>
	<style type="text/css">
		html, body
		{
			margin				: 0;
			padding				: 0;
            width				: 100%;
            height              : 100%;

		}       

		.dvMain
		{
            max-width           : 980px;
            height              : 100%;
            margin              : 0 auto;
            display             : flex;
            flex-direction      : column;
            justify-content     : center;
		}

        .dvMain .mainContent
        {
            display             : flex;
            justify-content     : space-between;
            align-items         : center;
        }
        
        .dvMain .textContent
		{
			display             : flex;
            flex-direction      : column;
            gap                 : 60px;
		}

        .dvMain .textContent img
        {
            width               : 180px;
            height              : 50px;
            border              : 0;
        }

        .dvMain .textContent .text h1 
        {
            color               : #000;
            font-family         : Pretendard;
            font-size           : 34px;
            font-style          : normal;
            font-weight         : 700;
            line-height         : normal;
        }

        .dvMain .textContent .text .subText
        {
            display             : flex;
            flex-direction      : column;
            gap                 : 9px;             
            color               : #000;
            font-family         : Pretendard;
            font-size           : 24px;
            font-style          : normal;
            font-weight         : 400;
            line-height         : normal;     
        }

        .dvMain .textContent .dvBtn
        {
            display             : flex;
            flex-direction      : column;
            justify-content     : center;
            width               : 330px;
            height              : 45px;
            border-radius       : 6px;
            border              : 1px #00B336;
            background          : #00B336;
            text-align          : center;
            font-family         : Helvetica;
            font-size           : 28px;
            font-style          : normal;
            font-weight         : 700;
            line-height         : normal;
            letter-spacing      : 1px;
            color               : #FFF;
            margin-top          : 30px;
            padding             : 9px 0;
        }

        .dvMain .imageContent img
        {
            width               : 250px;
            height              : 250px;
            border              : 0;
        }

        @media screen and (max-width: 768px) {
            .dvMain .mainContent
            {
                flex-direction  : column-reverse;
                text-align      : center;
                gap             : 70px;     
                padding         : 0 15px;  
            }

            .dvMain .mainContent .textContent
            {
                align-items     : center;
            }

            .dvMain .textContent
            {
                gap             : 50px;
            }

            .dvMain .textContent img
            {
                width           : 120px;
                height          : 35px;
            }

            .dvMain .textContent .text h1 
            {
                font-size       : 25px;
            }

            .dvMain .textContent .text .subText
            {       
                gap             : 12px;   
                font-size       : 16px;
            }

            .dvMain .imageContent img
            {
                width               : 210px;
                height              : 210px;
            }

            .dvMain .textContent .dvBtn
            {

                width           : 270px;
                font-size       : 20px;
                padding         : 3px 0;
            }
        }

        @media screen and (max-width: 768px) and (max-height: 700px) {
            .dvMain .mainContent
            {
                gap             : 30px;     
            }

            .dvMain .textContent
            {
                gap             : 30px;
            }

            .dvMain .imageContent img
            {
                width           : 180px;
                height          : 180px;
            }
        }


	</style>
    <script>
        function goHome()
        {
            if(window.innerWidth > 768) {
                window.location.replace("https://domeggook.com");
            } else {
                window.location.replace("https://mobile.domeggook.com");
            }
        }

    </script>
</head>
<body>
	<div class='dvMain'>
        <div class="mainContent">
            <div class="textContent">
                <img src='https://cdn1.domeggook.com/image/common/img_domeggookLogo2.png'/>
                <div class="text">
                    <h1>페이지를 찾을 수 없습니다.</h1>
    
                    <div class="subText">
                        <div>요청한 페이지는 없는 페이지 이거나 접근이 제한된 페이지입니다.</div>
                        <div>입력한 URL을 다시 확인해 주세요.</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <a onclick="goHome()" class="dvBtn">홈으로 이동하기</a>
            </div>
            <div class="imageContent">
                <img src='https://cdn1.domeggook.com/image/common/error/403_404_error.png'/>
            </div>
        </div>
	</div>
</body>
</html>